  "repairs": [
    "Prepared complete model/relay arrays; warm-direct then bounded two-definition exact-signature whole-epoch capture/replay. Five executables precede any actual graph launch; no fallback after partial/unknown launch.",
    "Captured relay kernels read an immutable-per-flight activation word; KV/binding changes recapture after native and CPU-reader drain. Unended capture cannot satisfy finished.",
    "Control-only hot poll/publish avoids native tail queries and device switches; snapshot/close retains actual completion checks.",
    "Two bounded single-workgroup relay kernels per rank/boundary, all-writer system publication and actual last-reader ack, four-value copies without invented 16-byte view alignment.",
    "Decoded-Q8/F32 four-output subgroup projection without LDS barriers or activation requantization; ordered finite-checked CPU SIMD across independent elements."
  ],
